      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.citydirectory.us/village-waite-hill.html"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The village’s median age is about 52 years, reflecting its mature, family‑friendly community.",
